    "text": "By Daniel Gallen ,\n1 days ago Conference play has finally arrived. After mostly rolling through its non-conference slate, Penn State is 3-0, ranked in the top 15 of the national polls and receiving some buzz as a potential College Football Playoff team. On Saturday, the Nittany Lions can begin to reveal what type of team they truly are when Wisconsin visits for the Big Ten opener. Read full article",
